Player Home Select Travelers Journal
    Events
        Player - Player 1 (Red) Selects a unit
    Conditions
        (Unit-type of (Triggering unit)) Equal to Traveler's Journal 2
        (Remaining time for DialogOverTimer) Equal to 0.00
    Actions
        -------- SET --------
        Set VariableSet PlayerHomeTravelersJournal = (Triggering unit)
        Set VariableSet PlayerHomeTempPoint = (Position of PlayerHomeTravelersJournal)
        Set VariableSet PlayerHomeUnit = (Random unit from (Units within 300.00 of PlayerHomeTempPoint matching (((Matching unit) Equal to Nazgrek) or ((Matching unit) Equal to Zulkis)).))
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_PlayerHomeTempPoint)
        -------- SET --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                Or - Any (Conditions) are true
                    Conditions
                        PlayerHomeUnit Equal to Nazgrek
                        PlayerHomeUnit Equal to Zulkis
            Then - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        PlayerHomeTravelersJournal Not equal to PlayerHomeTravelersJournalSel
                    Then - Actions
                        Trigger - Turn off (This trigger)
                        -------- ======== CINEMATIC STARTS ======== --------
                        Trigger - Run Cinematic ON <gen> (checking conditions)
                        -------- Camera --------
                        Cinematic - Turn cinematic mode On for (All players)
                        Camera - Apply TravelersJournalCamera2 <gen> for Player 1 (Red) over 0.00 seconds
                        Camera - Apply TravelersJournalCamera <gen> for Player 1 (Red) over 3.00 seconds
                        Camera - Pan camera for Player 1 (Red) to (Position of PlayerHomeTravelersJournal) over 0.00 seconds
                        Wait 1.00 seconds
                        Unit - Make PlayerHomeUnit face PlayerHomeTravelersJournal over 0.75 seconds
                        -------- Run "Create Dialog" --------
                        Wait 2.00 seconds
                        Trigger - Run Player Home Dialog <gen> (checking conditions)
                        Trigger - Turn on (This trigger)
                        Skip remaining actions
                    Else - Actions
                        Game - Display to (All players) the text: |cFFFFCC00Traveler'...
                        Trigger - Run Hint 3 Travelers Journal 1 <gen> (checking conditions)
            Else - Actions
